{
 "nodes": [
  {
   "id": "n1",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": -520,
   "width": 900,
   "height": 160,
   "text": "# One layer (L2, Full mode) — true-scale matrices\nAttention ≈ 0.13B · shared expert + gate ≈ 0.04B · routed experts ≈ 13.59B (384 × 3 matrices). Same scale for every rectangle."
  },
  {
   "id": "n2",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -400,
   "y": -520,
   "width": 520,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "# How to read\n- **Rectangle = weight matrix W[out×in]**: width = in, height = out, **0.04 px per channel** in this tab → **area = parameters**.\n- **Stacked offset copies** = the same matrix repeated (heads, experts, layers).\n- **Thin grey bar** = one token's activation; width = channels.\n- Zoom out to compare; nothing is resized for readability."
  },
  {
   "id": "n3",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -410,
   "y": -250,
   "width": 819,
   "height": 10,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "n4",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 424,
   "y": -262,
   "width": 260,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`20480` residual stream = 4 copies × 5120 (mHC)"
  },
  {
   "id": "n5",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -410,
   "y": -200,
   "width": 819,
   "height": 2,
   "text": "",
   "color": "1"
  },
  {
